This product includes no student data, teacher files or school logos. The school
name, report texts and logos a user enters stay in that user's browser, in the
backup files and in the school pack files they download.

Valedocs bundles two font files, unmodified, in src/ui/fonts/: Atkinson
Hyperlegible (Regular and Bold), Copyright 2020 Braille Institute of America,
Inc., licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org). The full licence text is next to the fonts, in
OFL.txt, and goes with them in every build.

The exports use these libraries, installed from npm as dependencies and bundled
into the built site: ExcelJS (MIT), jsPDF and jsPDF-AutoTable (MIT), fflate
(MIT) and idb-keyval (Apache-2.0). jsPDF in turn bundles DOMPurify (MPL-2.0 or
Apache-2.0) and html2canvas (MIT). Each library's own licence is in its package
under node_modules/.

Valedocs is not affiliated with any school, ministry of education or Google.
